@node CSKY Options
@section Options
@cindex CSKY options (none)
@cindex options for CSKY (none)

@table @code
There are a few options for C-SKY assembler, the details are following:

@cindex @code{-mcpu=} command line option, CSKY
@item -mcpu=@var{processor}
